ntativeness":0.9160772562026978,"text_excerpt":"This is a really cool spot that I had no idea even existed! This is basically different spaces that you can rent for whatever your needs, whether it be dance or photography. The space that we were in was $30 for an hour, which is really perfect if you are giving a quick dance lesson or if you need space for a photo shoot. The studio we used had really big windows that let in a lot of light and make the area perfect for photography. It also had a huge mirror that was fun to play around with. So many artists in this town are looking for open spaces in which to work, and I think that Nola Spaces is perfect for just that. The staff is friendly and accommodating and will put you in the space t..."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
